{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">The Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  Shadow Stalker is an asymmetrical multiplayer horror experience. One player takes on the role of <strong>\u201cThe Hunted,\u201d</strong> a near-invisible monstrosity armed with supernatural abilities, while 2\u20138 other players team up as <strong>\u201cThe Hunters,\u201d</strong> a well-equipped elite task force.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">...Over here...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  The Hunted thrives in the shadows, barely perceptible to the naked eye. Despite the number of Hunters outnumbering The Hunted, The Hunted\u2019s unique powers can even the odds:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spectral distortion\u00a0</strong>\u2013 They can't shoot what they don't see.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2364290/extras/bc72f26874b30bf5e4b10e2235762ee6.poster.avif?t=1770446989\" width=1170 height=730 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2364290/extras/bc72f26874b30bf5e4b10e2235762ee6.webm?t=1770446989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2364290/extras/bc72f26874b30bf5e4b10e2235762ee6.mp4?t=1770446989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wall Climbing</strong> \u2013 Scale walls, crawl along ceilings, and strike from impossible angles.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2364290/extras/66352bfc14f0a3008b15a270d6827680.poster.avif?t=1770446989\" width=1170 height=648 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2364290/extras/66352bfc14f0a3008b15a270d6827680.webm?t=1770446989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2364290/extras/66352bfc14f0a3008b15a270d6827680.mp4?t=1770446989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>  </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Raise the Dead</strong> \u2013 Reanimate defeated NPCs and players to create a shambling horde that can sniff out  the hunters. <br>  </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2364290/extras/3b8e41a98235c543255d25242079c909.poster.avif?t=1770446989\" width=1170 height=746 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2364290/extras/3b8e41a98235c543255d25242079c909.webm?t=1770446989\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2364290/extras/3b8e41a98235c543255d25242079c909.mp4?t=1770446989\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">Hunt or Be Hunted</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  Step into the boots of a Hunter, a member of an elite squad tasked with bringing down The Hunted. Work as a team, keep your eyes peeled, and use advanced tactics to corner your prey. Armed with high-tech weapons and gadgets, you\u2019ll need to stay alert; or you might just find yourself on the receiving end of the hunt.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Custom loadouts\u00a0</strong>\u2013 Customize your loadouts for maximum survivability.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https: